 "lineage_notes": [
  "garas is a LoRA on the student's own base (stock Gemma-4-31B-it): a Gemma-lineage teacher, not independent of the student.",
  "d3 and pplx are both full fine-tunes of Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B @1d4bf0f2 with the same 255-code last-token readout design; d3's noncausal mask hook is adapted from pplx: treat them as ONE lineage when counting independent teachers.",
  "olmo (Ai2 Olmo 3.1 32B Think) is pretrained from scratch on Dolma 3: independent of Gemma and Qwen at pretraining; its Dolci-Think SFT traces were generated by DeepSeek R1 / R1-0528 (Dolci card), so its post-training shares a DeepSeek signal."
 ],
 "exposure_notes": [
  "Teacher training exposure is partly unknown: our split guarantees do not establish that a public source is unseen by a teacher (ROADMAP Stage 0). pplx's training data include tasksource typed-decisions conversions (BASE3 notes), so its correctness on tasksource-derived discovery rows may reflect fitting; d3's data are undisclosed ('No Decision Index evaluation items were used in training'); Garas = (99), trained on our own jev mixtures; Olmo's post-training data are public (Dolci)."
 ],
